00:08:31,578 --> 00:08:37,578
Rogue River is a horror, thriller film directed by Jourdan McClure.

3
00:12:47,368 --> 00:12:53,368
When a young woman takes a trip down Rogue River,
her car mysteriously disappears.

4
00:17:03,157 --> 00:17:09,157
Lost without transport or communication, she accepts the hospitality of a
stranger who offers her shelter for the night at his cabin.

5
00:21:18,947 --> 00:21:24,947
With no other options available, she reluctantly
accepts only to forever regret it.

6
00:25:34,736 --> 00:25:40,736
The ensuing hours yield nothing but torture,
indescribable pain, and horrific agony.

7
00:29:50,526 --> 00:29:56,526
If you've seen Misery, you've seen nothing.

8
00:34:06,315 --> 00:34:12,315
This movie starts where horror films end and leaves
viewers paralysed by fear and disgust.

